## Status

Self-excluded: **no verified public benchmark numbers** were found for the exact model/ID `deepseek-v4.1-flash` in accessible sources at time of research.

## Research notes

- Verified metadata from accessible sources (not benchmark scores): Artificial Analysis lists DeepSeek V4.1 Flash (Max) as an open-weights reasoning model (released 2026-09-10, deprecated in favor of DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 in AA view) with 552B total / 16B active parameters (MoE), 1M context window, text+image input, text output, MIT license, and median pricing around $0.29/$1.20 per 1M tokens. OpenRouter lists `deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash` with broad provider availability and pricing tiers.
- Artificial Analysis reported Intelligence Index and task-level benchmark aggregates as unavailable/N/A ("No publicly available API" / unknown) in the fetched snapshot; no standalone verified benchmark scores (e.g. GPQA, SWE-bench, HLE, MMMU, Terminal-Bench, LiveCodeBench, etc.) for this exact model/ID were found in accessible sources.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`: if zero verified public benchmark numbers are found for the exact model/ID, save a notes-only `.md.excluded` file and do not invent placeholder scores.

